# 10. What is `fake()`?

Laravel provides a Faker instance through:

```php
fake()
```

It generates fake data.

Examples:

```php
fake()->name()
```

Example result:

```text
John Smith
```

```php
fake()->email()
```

Example:

```text
john@example.com
```

```php
fake()->phoneNumber()
```

Example:

```text
+91 9876543210
```

```php
fake()->address()
```

Example:

```text
123 Main Street
```

```php
fake()->city()
```

Example:

```text
Mumbai
```

```php
fake()->sentence()
```

Example:

```text
The project is currently under development.
```

