# 29. Using Factory in Tinker

Run:

```bash
php artisan tinker
```

Then:

```php
Project::factory()->create();
```

Create 10:

```php
Project::factory()->count(10)->create();
```

Check:

```php
Project::all();
```

You should see the generated records.

Exit Tinker:

```php
