```

---

# 30. Factory + Seeder

Factories are frequently combined with seeders.

For example:

```text
Factory
   ↓
defines HOW fake data looks

Seeder
   ↓
defines HOW MANY records to create
```

Example:

```php
Project::factory()
    ->count(20)
    ->create();
```

Then run:

```bash
php artisan db:seed
```

---

# 31. Factory + DatabaseSeeder

For example:

```php
<?php

namespace Database\Seeders;

use App\Models\Project;
use Illuminate\Database\Seeder;

class DatabaseSeeder extends Seeder
{
    public function run(): void
    {
        Project::factory()
            ->count(20)
            ->create();
    }
}
```

Then:

```bash
php artisan db:seed
```

Laravel creates 20 projects.

