# 34. Common Mistakes

## Mistake 1 — Wrong factory name

For:

```text
Project
```

use:

```text
ProjectFactory
```

not:

```text
ProjectsFactory
```

The normal convention follows the model's singular class name.

---

## Mistake 2 — Wrong directory

Correct:

```text
database/factories/ProjectFactory.php
```

---

## Mistake 3 — Forgetting `HasFactory`

Your model should normally contain:

```php
use Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Factories\HasFactory;
```

and:

```php
use HasFactory;
```

---

## Mistake 4 — Using database column names incorrectly

Your current column is:

```text
project_name
```

Therefore the factory should use:

```php
'project_name' => fake()->sentence(3),
```

not:

```php
'project' => fake()->sentence(3),
```

---

## Mistake 5 — Expecting `make()` to insert data

This:

```php
Project::factory()->make();
```

does not insert into the database.

This:

```php
Project::factory()->create();
```

does.

---

## Mistake 6 — Trying to generate `id`

Normally don't do:

```php
'id' => fake()->randomNumber(),
```

if the database already has:

```php
$table->id();
```

because the database automatically generates the primary key.

