# 36. The Complete Mental Model

Remember this flow:

```text
                    MODEL
                      │
                      │
              use HasFactory
                      │
                      ↓
               Project::factory()
                      │
                      ↓
              ProjectFactory
                      │
                      ↓
               definition()
                      │
                      ↓
                  fake()
                      │
                      ↓
              Fake Project Data
                      │
              ┌───────┴────────┐
              │                │
            make()           create()
              │                │
              ↓                ↓
          Memory          Database
                               │
                               ↓
                         projects table
```

The most important distinction is:

```text
Factory
   ↓
Defines fake data

make()
   ↓
Creates model in memory

create()
   ↓
Creates model + saves to database

Seeder
   ↓
Uses factories to populate the database
```

And the standard Laravel convention is:

```text
Model:
app/Models/Project.php

Factory:
database/factories/ProjectFactory.php

Factory command:
php artisan make:factory ProjectFactory --model=Project

Factory method:
definition()

Generate:
Project::factory()->create()

Generate many:
Project::factory()->count(10)->create()
```

